# The first three derive from upstream with only two paired-sentinel lines added.
# example-swimlane.html is no longer an unchanged import (2026-08-30).
#
# Porting up:archify's orthogonality check exposed two diagonal connectors here.
# Upstream comments said "diagonal down-right", indicating an intentional choice.
# Our connector-rules.md rule 1 makes diagonal connectors an automatic failure:
# preserving upstream would ship an example that violates our own rules.
# Models learn from examples, so the invalid example can outweigh the rule.
#
# To follow our rule, both connectors now use orthogonal L paths (H → Q rounding → V).
# This changes the upstream hash. The original hash was
